    },
    {
     "note": "The 3rd and 4th conjugations put an <em>e</em> before the <em>-ba-</em>: <em>trahebam</em>, <em>audiebam</em>. <em>sum</em> has no <em>-ba-</em> at all, but its person endings are the same: <em>eram, erat, erant</em>."
    }
